\newlabel{fig:coverage}{{2}{6}{Joint coverage by condition, dimension, and nominal level. Small dots show individual seeds; horizontal colored marks show means; dashed lines show nominal coverage. H: homoscedastic; B: boundary-concentrated heteroscedastic; S: B response mechanism with shifted test covariates. Panels share an axis spanning all observations. Shifted coverage is an empirical stress test, not a validity guarantee}{figure.caption.6}{}}
